### Tes API memakai ekstensi "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) di VS Code.
### Klik "Send Request" yang muncul di atas tiap request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Buat produk baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headset Gaming",
  "description": "Headset 7.1 surround dengan mic",
  "price": 350000,
  "stock": 15
}

### Daftar produk (dengan pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&limit=5

### Cari produk berdasarkan nama
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=mouse

### Detail produk
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1

### Update produk
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Mekanik RGB",
  "description": "Keyboard mekanik 75% dengan lampu RGB",
  "price": 550000,
  "stock": 20
}

### Hapus produk
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1

### Tes validasi (harus 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ab",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": -1
}


### --- Role & Pengguna (butuh login admin; cookie dari /auth/login) ---

### Daftar pengguna (admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### Buat pengguna baru (admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"budi","password":"rahasia123","full_name":"Budi Santoso","role":"manager"}

### Ubah role / nonaktifkan (admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"role":"staff","is_active":true}


### --- Supplier (baca: semua role, tulis: admin/manager, hapus: admin) ---

### Daftar (search, status=active|inactive, page, limit)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers?page=1&limit=8&search=jakarta&status=active

### Tambah
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"PT Contoh Supplier","contact_person":"Rina","email":"rina@contoh.example","phone":"021-5550404","city":"Jakarta","address":"Jl. Contoh No. 1","notes":"","is_active":true}

### Ubah
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"PT Sumber Elektronik","contact_person":"Andi","email":"","phone":"","city":"Jakarta","address":"","notes":"","is_active":false}

### Hapus (admin)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/suppliers/1
